# What `check-voice` and `sign-copy` read in this repo.
#
# Naming this file turns the default off, so the readme has to be listed
# as well: it is copy too, and leaving it out signs nothing and says
# everything is signed.
# Two of these are Rust, because most of what this building says is drawn
# on a screen rather than written in markdown. `says.rs` is what `--help`
# prints and `keys.rs` is the list behind H.
README.md
src/says.rs
src/keys.rs
